Halonic WSL image
=================

This image is a minimal Debian system plus a few Debian packages (see
packages.txt for the exact list and versions). Every Debian package keeps its
licence text in /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright.

Source code: for each Debian package in packages.txt, the matching source is
available from Debian. This image is built from the Debian snapshot named in
SNAPSHOT.txt, so the exact source can be fetched with:

    apt-get source <package>=<version>

after adding the "deb-src" lines for that snapshot (the file
/etc/apt/sources.list.d/debian.sources already carries deb-src entries for
Debian's own mirrors), or by browsing https://snapshot.debian.org/ at the
timestamp in SNAPSHOT.txt.

The recipe that built this image is in https://github.com/halonic-com/halonic,
folder infra/wsl-image. Halonic's own code in /opt/halonic carries its own
licence files.
